        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In blue yarn, start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-a179"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: (2 dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (24 sts). Rounds 5-10: dc around. Round 11: (2 dc, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-a179"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ") x 6 (18 sts). Round 12: (dc, dc2tog) x 6 (12 sts). Stuff. Apply "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-finish-a179"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible finish"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and close."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tail fin"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 8. Dc in 2nd chain from hook, dc to end (7 sts). Work 2 more rows dc. Fold in half and slip stitch the two short ends together to form a V-shape tail. Leave a sewing tail."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Flippers (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Magic ring, 6 dc. Round 2: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 3 (9 sts). Slip stitch to close. Leave a sewing tail."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the tail fin to the narrow end of the body. Sew one flipper to each side, roughly one third of the way from the nose end. Embroider a small eye on each side. Embroider a curved spout line on the top. Attach a keychain clip to the top of the body."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
